request.description:
Retrieves complete dental chart for a patient including all teeth data, conditions, and procedures.

**Response Format:**
```json
{
  "message": "Dental chart retrieved successfully",
  "data": {
    "patient_id": "PAT-00001",
    "chart_type": "adult",
    "last_updated": "2024-11-20T10:30:00Z",
    "teeth": {
      "11": {
        "tooth_number": 11,
        "status": "has-condition",
        "conditions": [...],
        "procedures": [...]
      },
      "16": {...}
    },
    "summary": {
      "total_teeth_affected": 6,
      "total_conditions": 8,
      "total_procedures": 10,
      "completed_procedures": 4,
      "planned_procedures": 3,
      "in_progress_procedures": 3
    }
  }
}
```

body.raw:
{
  "patient_id": "{{patient_id}}",
  "chart_type": "adult",
  "teeth_data": {
    "11": {
      "tooth_number": 11,
      "status": "has-condition",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "type": "cavity",
          "severity": "moderate",
          "notes": "Small cavity on mesial surface",
          "date": "2024-11-20"
        }
      ],
      "procedures": [
        {
          "name": "Filling",
          "status": "planned",
          "notes": "Composite filling scheduled",
          "date": "2024-11-25",
          "cost": 1500,
          "duration_minutes": 30
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}

request.description:
Adds a condition to one or multiple teeth. Supports bulk operations for applying same condition to multiple teeth.

**Response Format:**
```json
{
  "message": "Condition added successfully",
  "data": {
    "condition_ids": ["COND-001", "COND-002", "COND-003"],
    "affected_teeth": [11, 12, 13]
  }
}
```

Updates an existing tooth condition.

**Response Format:**
```json
{
  "message": "Condition updated successfully",
  "data": {
    "condition_id": "COND-001",
    "tooth_number": 11,
    "updated_at": "2024-11-20T10:30:00Z"
  }
}
```

Removes a condition from a tooth. Maintains audit trail by storing reason for removal.

**Response Format:**
```json
{
  "message": "Condition removed successfully",
  "data": {
    "condition_id": "COND-001",
    "tooth_number": 11,
    "removed_at": "2024-11-20T10:30:00Z"
  }
}
```

Returns list of available condition types with metadata.

**Response Format:**
```json
{
  "message": "Condition types retrieved successfully",
  "data": [
    {
      "value": "cavity",
      "label": "Cavity",
      "description": "Tooth decay or dental caries",
      "severity_options": ["mild", "moderate", "severe"]
    },
    {
      "value": "crown",
      "label": "Crown",
      "description": "Dental crown placement",
      "severity_options": null
    }
  ]
}
```

