request.description:
Adds a procedure to one or multiple teeth. Automatically creates initial timeline entry.

**Response Format:**
```json
{
  "message": "Procedure added successfully",
  "data": {
    "procedure_ids": ["PROC-001"],
    "affected_teeth": [11],
    "timeline_created": true
  }
}
```

body.raw:
{
  "patient_id": "{{patient_id}}",
  "tooth_number": 11,
  "procedure_id": "PROC-001",
  "updates": {
    "name": "Root Canal Treatment with Crown",
    "notes": "Additional crown placement required",
    "cost": 5000,
    "duration_minutes": 120
  }
}

request.description:
Updates procedure details without changing status (no timeline entry created).

**Response Format:**
```json
{
  "message": "Procedure updated successfully",
  "data": {
    "procedure_id": "PROC-001",
    "tooth_number": 11,
    "updated_at": "2024-11-20T10:30:00Z"
  }
}
```

Removes a procedure from a tooth. Maintains audit trail.

**Response Format:**
```json
{
  "message": "Procedure removed successfully",
  "data": {
    "procedure_id": "PROC-001",
    "tooth_number": 11,
    "removed_at": "2024-11-20T10:30:00Z"
  }
}
```

Retrieves complete timeline history for a specific procedure.

**Response Format:**
```json
{
  "message": "Procedure timeline retrieved successfully",
  "data": {
    "procedure_id": "PROC-001",
    "procedure_name": "Root Canal Treatment",
    "tooth_number": 11,
    "current_status": "in-progress",
    "timeline": [
      {
        "status": "planned",
        "timestamp": "2024-11-15T10:30:00Z",
        "notes": "Treatment plan approved",
        "changed_by": "Dr. John Smith"
      },
      {
        "status": "in-progress",
        "timestamp": "2024-11-18T09:15:00Z",
        "notes": "First session completed",
        "changed_by": "Dr. John Smith"
      }
    ]
  }
}
```

